QUEUE.jsonl

# Private project plans — never commit to public repo
# Plans are external-mode (vidux.config.json) and stay local.
# Use `projects/*` (not `projects/`) so subdirectory exceptions can re-include.
projects/*
# Exception: vidux-browser is internal-to-vidux tooling, ships with the code.
!projects/vidux-browser/
# Exception: resplit-2-0-weekend-push is the active ship plan for Resplit 2.0
# (May 2026 launch window). Tracked so both Macs see the same plan.
!projects/resplit-2-0-weekend-push/
# Exception: ocr-moat is the post-2.0-launch foundation project for vendor-neutral
# receipt scanning. Tracked so all agents converge on the same plan.
!projects/ocr-moat/
# Exception: higgs-reader-poc is the quality-gate PoC for Higgs Audio V2 TTS —
# verifying whether it can read out Claude analysis on walks. Tracked so the
# autonomous /loop cron can resume across sessions / machines.
!projects/higgs-reader-poc/
# Exception: voxtral-reader-addon is the active vidux-browse 🔊 Read-aloud
# add-on plan (Mistral Voxtral 4B WebGPU, browser-local, personal use only).
# Replaces higgs-reader-poc as the active reader project.
!projects/voxtral-reader-addon/
# Exception: resplit-2-0-localized-screenshots is the multi-day expedition for
# 9-locale ASC screenshots + Anthropic computer-use verification. Companion to
# resplit-2-0-weekend-push (bug-fix lane). Tracked so all agents converge on
# the same plan across machines.
!projects/resplit-2-0-localized-screenshots/
# Exception: resplit-2-0-1 is the post-launch punch-list — Tier-2 backlog
# activated AFTER 2.0 ships. Brand-frozen items unfreeze here. Net-new feature
# pump turns ON here. Tracked so all agents converge on the same dormant plan.
!projects/resplit-2-0-1/
# Exception: ui-test-sweep-2026-05-07 is the post-build-2429 P0 iOS UI sweep
# (Leo verbatim 2026-05-07: "10000% clarity on ui testing"). Sibling of
# resplit-2-0-1 punch-list. Tracked so sim-walker subagents converge on the
# same walk plan.
!projects/ui-test-sweep-2026-05-07/
# Exception: team-agent-coordination is the cross-skill coordination expedition
# (cron-registry, claim bus, /auto gate, /nia preflight, phase-shift). Authority
# Store for the fire-and-forget /goal that drives the fleet to operate as a team
# rather than as siloed crons. Tracked so all crons + machines see the same plan.
!projects/team-agent-coordination/
# Exception: observability-bus is the multi-PR expedition adding a
# vendor-agnostic ObservabilityBus + N pluggable EventSink adapters
# (Sentry, PostHog, Console, future vendors) to Resplit iOS. Pivoted
# from sentry-rum-correlation 2026-05-09 per Leo "tie sessions across
# all external vendors now and future". Tracked so multi-agent lanes
# (A/B/C/D) converge on the same plan.
!projects/observability-bus/
# Exception: vidux-pilot-merge is a 3-commit expedition to consolidate /pilot
# and /vidux into a single skill (Leo 2026-05-13). Tracked so the M4 can
# resume the merge across machines.
!projects/vidux-pilot-merge/

# Temp files from checkpoint script
tmp*.md

# External board sync sidecars
.external-state.json

# Claude Code local state
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json

# Secrets / environment — never commit
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
secrets/

# Browser runtime artifacts (user-generated HTML, not source)
browser/artifacts/*
!browser/artifacts/.gitkeep
.playwright-cli/
vidux.config.json
